        {
          "Id": "alex_q_who",
          "PromptText": "My name is Alex Gibbs, I am in charge of maintaining the automated help around this industrial park. An engineer by trade, robotics have been something I have specialized in for the majority of my life. Robots are so much simpler to deal with...one of these service droids will never break your heart! Well, they could literally, as they have sharp claws.\\n\\nIf anything mechanical breaks down, it ends up here, where it is serviced and restored to working order.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-Alex-dialog packets.hex.log #301",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_who_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "I didn't see too many robots working out in the yard.",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:34.9711890Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_q_robots",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_who_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:34.9711890Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_goodbye",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "alex_q_robots",
          "PromptText": "I am working on that! You sound worse than my superiors. Yes, I know. There aren't any working robots... working. It is near impossible to keep up with the demand. The hazards of this area break them down faster than I can fix them...and then there are the people who come around and sabotage them for sport.\\n\\nI love my metal babies, and putting them together gives me great joy...it's just difficult to see them in such disrepair.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-Alex-dialog packets.hex.log #321",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_robots_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "What do you do around here?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:37.1658363Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_q_what_do",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_robots_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Have you been working here for a while?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:37.1658363Z; not selected",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_q_uncaptured",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_robots_option_2",
              "Index": 2,
              "Text": "What goes on here?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:37.1658363Z; not selected",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_q_uncaptured",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_robots_option_3",
              "Index": 3,
              "Text": "Who is in charge around here?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:37.1658363Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_q_in_charge",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_robots_option_4",
              "Index": 4,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:37.1658363Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_goodbye",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "alex_q_what_do",
          "PromptText": "I am in charge of building and repairing anything automated or mechanical around here. There isn't too much left, outside of this area or the junkyard, with the exception of boss Calitri's sentry robots, but I am working to fix that.\\n\\nSadly, funding is being gouged from my budget. Desmond Calitri, the appointed administrator of this industrial area, seems to believe in manpower over automated power.\\n\\nWhile...I suppose...admirable in thought...some jobs are just more suited for automated constructs which can...you know...be rebuilt. Desmond just keeps sending his army of disposable laborers into more and more risky situations to cut costs.\\n\\nI suppose I can appreciate the fleshy workers, but there's a place for the metal helpers as well...even if they may cost more to maintain and produce.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-Alex-dialog packets.hex.log #350",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_what_do_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Where do these workers come from?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:39.4384343Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_q_workers",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_what_do_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:39.4384343Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_goodbye",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "alex_q_workers",
          "PromptText": "I am not really sure, but Desmond Calitri does not seem to have a problem finding some new Atrox dock workers when the need arises. We have always staffed a lot of them around here, but since Desmond Calitri came into power, they have almost phased out my robots.\\n\\nIt may be a cost-saving measure, or nepotism, but there have been many more accidents as of recently.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-Alex-dialog packets.hex.log #364",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_workers_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "Isn't it a good thing that Desmond Calitri is giving so many of these people work?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:40.9864808Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_q_good_thing",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_workers_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:40.9864808Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_goodbye",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "alex_q_good_thing",
          "PromptText": "You assume that these are citizens who have a life outside of their jobs. \\n\\nI suspect that Desmond Calitri has a contract with a facility who clones these workers, cheap, and for the sole purpose of this slave labor. It's impossible to prove, however...unless I could get a little closer.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-Alex-dialog packets.hex.log #391",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_good_thing_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "You sound like you have an idea in mind.",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:42.8213483Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_q_idea",
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_good_thing_option_1",
              "Index": 1,
              "Text": "Goodbye",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:42.8213483Z",
              "NextNodeId": "alex_goodbye",
              "Actions": []
            }
          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "alex_q_idea",
          "PromptText": "Yes, actually. I have a scheme that should allow me to know what exactly is going on around here. If there is something going on, it shouldn't be too hard to uncover.\\n\\nBetween the phasing out of my robots, in addition to the protests from overworked Dockworkers, Desmond Calitri should be having a difficult time keeping all of his secrets locked down.\\n\\nIf you do want to help out, just let me know.",
          "PromptTextConfidence": "KnubotAppendText 20260722-Alex-dialog packets.hex.log #412",
          "Options": [
            {
              "Id": "alex_q_idea_option_0",
              "Index": 0,
              "Text": "What do you do around here?",
              "TextEvidence": "KnuBotAnswerList 2026-07-22T13:07:44.5592769Z",
