            {
              "Text": "\\n\\nThat individual would be Desmond Calitri. A cutthroat, shrewd individual. He's currently in the business of overseeing this dock area, and is pushing the workers around like slaves.\\n\\nWhile sending all of my robots in for repair, and opting to limit our funding, he is breaking the backs of the laborforce.\\n\\nHe has an elevated office under the landing platforms. If you need to talk to him, it's hard to miss.",
